{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>視后江美儀早前被爆兩年前拍攝TVB綜藝節目《一個好人》，落區做義工幫基層滅蟲時「假善心」及「做騷」。滅蟲組織負責人陳家駱（阿臣）突發長文，指控江美儀當日拍攝時遲到兼態度高冷，在現場拿着蒸氣機擺姿態拍攝兩小時後便離場，將剩餘98%的滅蟲工作留給他一人處理，質疑節目組和江美儀的義工服務只是「為做騷」，並非真心行善。事後江美儀以短訊回覆《香港01》表示：「唔係事實嘅嘢，唔回應啦，多謝！」她亦於社交平台引用魯迅的經典詩句「橫眉冷對千夫指，俯首甘為孺子牛」表態。</p><figure><img alt=\"江美儀在節目中對床蝨表示恐懼。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1186018891525001216128697.jpeg/bQpGBF8jPw-OZBXdJ60B85De3h8AyjJN3focmd36HJk\"/><figcaption>江美儀在節目中對床蝨表示恐懼。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳家駱控訴視后遲到高冷僅拍2%進度。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1186017864415449088062849.jpeg/ihRjuuk7a3Cth65sboy5uOMY59-lA3_qhM7wwoTO8MI\"/><figcaption>陳家駱控訴視后遲到高冷僅拍2%進度。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀為善舉「豁出去」。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1186019096370614272583794.jpeg/o0FP26u5auBjKbKmXSICs5GI9iPcaTObRCBQ30QgUN8\"/><figcaption>江美儀為善舉「豁出去」。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀被爆鏡頭前拿着蒸氣機擺姿態拍攝兩小時。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1186018491036078080032941.jpeg/vOQCefKXQ_aolaYCop__qsktUEer7yunscucy7HLnMs\"/><figcaption>江美儀被爆鏡頭前拿着蒸氣機擺姿態拍攝兩小時。（YouTube@TVB USA Official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大爆料。（Threads@LITTLE LIGHT）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186359083804921856501274.png/waD7Jyy5PjXXFb992HHPoGfqE1_0KOV1UOoTwVDqE8E\"/><figcaption>大爆料。（Threads@LITTLE LIGHT）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"滅蟲義工阿臣指江美儀斷章取義，為慳錢不敢出律師信。（Threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186628185748410368894015.jpeg/XOUEARG992wU2uYBFV9vMgtA1OQvYoBBuoRs37qEbN8\"/><figcaption>滅蟲義工阿臣指江美儀斷章取義，為慳錢不敢出律師信。（Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀以魯迅詩句「橫眉冷對千夫指 俯首甘為孺子牛」作為反擊。（Threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186627638270103552769580.jpeg/iHi0CoxpZieqO61gyy7RCbqB3sPA1O6u0ZcxVtGXMVY\"/><figcaption>江美儀以魯迅詩句「橫眉冷對千夫指 俯首甘為孺子牛」作為反擊。（Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>今日（17日）江美儀現身《善心滿載仁愛堂》活動，不過她在活動前透過公關表明不會接受訪問及不拍照。</p><figure><img alt=\"江美儀出席《善心滿載仁愛堂》活動。（盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188240416953602048610879.jpeg/WeWz-21jBubB7c1aIM_eU_tGRma0BFbZmmPgEaBj4BE\"/><figcaption>江美儀出席《善心滿載仁愛堂》活動。（盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀出席《善心滿載仁愛堂》活動。（盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188240414692741120796512.jpeg/PqNaMqlZXuNfOIlkZWHfX7-9KFUlg6cYdQpq5UAKauU\"/><figcaption>江美儀出席《善心滿載仁愛堂》活動。（盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188240412406714368174830.jpeg/Tc4-tZSrsqVWmGkDiRvMCmCF6_6ZHplsyLS5PvG0uT4\"/><figcaption>江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188240410254905344531426.jpeg/XPKexwGhkMK9S7l18niC6tEzRC-SeEwli4DdZrKA3WY\"/><figcaption>江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188240407876603904803261.jpeg/OygEPN8Rj8vtbh4PvQ0eHt7vp7qbAUhYp8M3JJLDNyQ\"/><figcaption>江美儀事先聲明不接受訪問。（盧振輝 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T13:39:05.360063+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":671,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T13:35:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:36.012586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T13:37:35.315478+00:00","content_hash":"4eefeb847b95f84a1497ad0c35e372b1b74b6f033d796af00ba5d5d43fa5ae7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}